  "idea": "Draw.io: free professional flowcharts and workflow diagrams",
  "text": "The free diagramming tool that integrates directly with Google Drive and GitHub. Engineering teams waste hours exporting flowcharts to PDFs and emailing revisions back and forth. Version drift happens when visual diagrams are stored separately from codebases and project documentation. Draw.io integrates natively with GitHub and Google Drive, letting you version-control diagrams alongside project repositories. You maintain single-source-of-truth system maps with zero friction.",
